                                        "entry_id": "533f22f3-4945-3a0d-99e8-7bbd0d8debbd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cathartic drug consisting of the tuberous roots of Ipomoea purga, a convolvulaceous plant found in Mexico."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
