                                                "sense_id": "7cfdd075-4770-3fb7-9dab-992d53d4a833",
                                                "text": "He’s stinking with money and thinks you’re not a gentleman. His old fellow made his tin by selling jalap to Zulus or some bloody swindle or other."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
